# COMPLETE CORRECTED FORM:

Copy this entire form to replace the one in ZTR_A2R_WBSZCJ01_PAI:

*&———————————————————————*
*& Form GET_FULLNAME_BY_UNAME
*&———————————————————————*

- Purpose: Get user’s full name from username
- Input: iv_uname - SAP username (like ‘HQ75177’)
- Output: ev_fullname - Full name (like ‘Marc Dexter Raymundo’)
  *&———————————————————————*
  FORM get_fullname_by_uname
  USING    iv_uname      TYPE xubname
  CHANGING ev_fullname   TYPE char50.

DATA: ls_addr TYPE bapiaddr3.

CLEAR ev_fullname.

“ Get user details from SAP
CALL FUNCTION ‘BAPI_USER_GET_DETAIL’
EXPORTING
username = iv_uname          “ ✓ Correct parameter
IMPORTING
address  = ls_addr           “ User address info
EXCEPTIONS
OTHERS   = 1.

IF sy-subrc = 0.
“ Check if fullname is populated
IF ls_addr-fullname IS NOT INITIAL.
ev_fullname = ls_addr-fullname.
ELSE.
“ If fullname empty, compose from first + last name
IF ls_addr-firstname IS NOT INITIAL OR ls_addr-lastname IS NOT INITIAL.
CONCATENATE ls_addr-firstname ls_addr-lastname
INTO ev_fullname SEPARATED BY space.
CONDENSE ev_fullname.
ELSE.
“ Fallback: use username if no name data
ev_fullname = iv_uname.
ENDIF.
ENDIF.
ELSE.
“ BAPI failed, return username as fallback
ev_fullname = iv_uname.
ENDIF.

ENDFORM.

